  "answer": "No, you cannot bring your Labrador in the hold on a flight from Tunis to Rome on 1 August. The hold is closed for pet transport between 15 June and 15 September (inclusive) on flights to or from Tunis-Carthage (TUN). Additionally, your Labrador must weigh no more than 45 kg including the crate to be accepted in the hold. Please note that brachycephalic breeds are also not accepted in the hold, but this applies to your Labrador only if it falls into that category. You may need to consider alternative travel arrangements for your pet during this period.",
